## 4. Figure 1: Static Geometric Matrix Baseline

**[EN]** This baseline chart visualizes the static interference field without phase rotation ($t = 0$), mapping the perfect mathematical symmetry of the regular octahedron grid.

**[DE]** Diese Basisgrafik visualisiert das statische Interferenzfeld ohne Phasenrotation ($t = 0$) und zeigt die perfekte mathematische Symmetrie des regulären Oktaeder-Gitters.

```{r, fig.align='center', fig.width=6, fig.height=5}
hologramm_statisch <- generate_dynamic_octahedron(k = 8.5, t = 0, rotate = FALSE)

ggplot(hologramm_statisch, aes(x = X, y = Y, fill = Intensitaet)) +
  geom_raster(interpolate = TRUE) +
  scale_fill_gradientn(colors = c("#05050A", "#0D1B2A", "#00FFCC", "#FFFFFF")) +
  theme_void() +
  labs(title = "// FIELD LOG: Static Octahedral Baseline Matrix") +
  theme(
    plot.background = element_rect(fill = "#05050A", color = NA),
    plot.title = element_text(color = "#00FFCC", family = "mono", size = 11, face = "bold"),
    legend.position = "none"
  )
```

